name: ['Approach of the Second Sun', 'Chandra, Torch of Defiance', 'Ethereal Armor', 'Hidden Strings', 'Isolate', 'Lurrus of the Dream-Den', 'Searing Blood', 'Silkwrap', 'Spell Queller', 'Wild Slash']
